+                                                        <p  class="paragraph">Deminer Viktoria, who moved to Mykolaiv from Ochakiv<sup class="footnote-ref"><a href="#fn-1" id="fnref-1" aria-label="Footnote 1">¹</a></sup>, has been working like this for almost a year. Her career path is similar to Andrii’s: she worked in education as a primary school teacher. Financial incentive wasn’t her main motivation, she says: “There are other jobs that are paid equally.”</p>
